    "title": "Air Force Grants Full Military Funeral Honors to Ashli Babbitt",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 04:21 AM UTC, Thu August 28, 2025\nAir Force Grants Full Military Funeral Honors to Ashli Babbitt\nWASHINGTON, D.C. — The United States Air Force will give full military funeral honors to Ashli Babbitt, an Air Force Veteran who was killed inside the U.S. capitol on January 6, 2021 by then Capitol Police Lt. Michael Byrd, according to Judicial Watch.\nMatthew L. Lohmeier\n\"After reviewing the circumstances of Ashli’s death, and considering the information that has come forward since then, I am persuaded that the previous determination was incorrect.\"\nTom Fitton\n\"Judicial Watch is proud to have done its part in bringing her family a measure of justice and accountability for Ashli’s outrageous killing.\"",
